        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Once the target dose is reached, we intend to pursue the clinical development of this product candidate with a tumor-agnostic approach in 2L PRAME solid cancers, initially focusing on gynecologic cancers.",
